This package combines HPE's Intel Ethernet firmware payload with Intel's
FreeBSD NVMUpdate utility.  It retains all 18 entries in HPE's configuration,
covering the HPE 361, 366, 369, 562, 563, and 568 adapter families based on
Intel I350, X550, X710, and X722 controllers.

Use nvmupdate-i350-x550-700series-hpe.
